  "description": "This best-selling bike has an international reputation for introducing the independence, power, and responsibility of riding at an early age. So, give your kiddo the bike that encourages the joy of riding …before they’re even out of diapers.\nWe believe in raising kids who always have the courage to tackle what comes next. Your tiny-legged toddler is ready to ride and craving adventure. That’s why we designed the Strider 12 Sport Balance Bike to be the ultimate vehicle to take kiddos from baby steps to big strides.\nFirst, it’s all about learning balance. Then, watch your kiddo’s confidence soar! See your little one experience the amazing freedom that comes with being a part of Team Strider. Soon they’ll gain the skills to keep up with you when you’re out and about. No more strollers needed.\nAbove all, you can become your kiddo’s biggest cheerleader with the best bike out there.",
